Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:41.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:42.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,退开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:41.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:41.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:43.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受伤了没
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:45.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:54.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刚刚那两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:56.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:03:59.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南风把她们引开了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一时半会儿回不来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:03.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天色不早了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:04.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们得加快速度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:07.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:09.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你可知那善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:10.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,长在城中何处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:13.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只知道古城的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,据说善月草叶大根细
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:22.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,矮小喜阴 形似尖桃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:24.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多生长于高大建筑旁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,高大建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:36.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毕竟在传说里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:38.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是王后摘取了善月草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:40.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么传说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,传说半月国主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀害了两只无辜的毒物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:46.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毒物心怀怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蝎尾蛇便是它们的后代
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:53.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可这 和善月草有什么关系呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:55.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那两只毒物死后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:57.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,王后摘了一片善月草叶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:58.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盖住它们的尸体以示仁慈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,从此这种叶子就可以解蝎尾蛇毒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,善月草 长在皇宫里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:11.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧 去皇宫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们分头找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:27.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.55,0:05:45.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,道长哥哥 别打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:02.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你当真是天生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我 真是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还有几个叔叔也跟着来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:11.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不信你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:13.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:17.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我在这呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:22.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们怎么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知你们何时回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们还是想办法跟过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们胆子也太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明知危险还敢跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:33.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幸好你们没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们怎么知道善月草在皇宫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:40.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们想着好东西肯定都藏在皇宫里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:41.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以就
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:46.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该就是它了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这药有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:08.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感觉好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:11.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:13.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:13.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 三郎\N- 快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:13.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:13.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 大家再找找\N- 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:13.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家再找找
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 多谢你了\N- 大家再找找
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:14.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:15.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:17.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去那头看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我这也找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:33.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:36.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭 你哪儿找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走走走 我们也去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:40.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多摘些还能卖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那里的草 你别用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:48.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:52.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是不是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:54.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:56.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走开 你踩到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:18.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家别慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一张人面而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁还没一张脸了不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,吓到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:31.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,唉 我也经常吓到我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:32.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:34.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们又是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:36.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,过路的商队
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,五六十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:43.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也曾是过路的商队
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:45.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那 那您老人家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:46.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为何会在这啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:51.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当初半月士兵抓了我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:52.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,埋在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:55.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把我当成善月草的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:08:59.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你用的那片没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎有心了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:04.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我好多年都没见过活人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们 你们都站过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让我好好看看 行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:09.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:10.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:11.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:14.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:18.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有件疑惑的事 想亲自确认
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:19.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们中有一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:29.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我五六十年前就见过了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:31.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你说的这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:33.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靠近点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家都退开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:37.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别信他的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你真的不想知道那人是谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:43.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他会害死你们所有人的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:46.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这又是何必
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会害你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:53.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别捡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:53.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:04.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:06.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吃 好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:08.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吃 饿死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:12.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,饿死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:42.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是 是半月士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:58.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先押走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:03.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别慌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:05.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们只是要把我们带去别处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,暂时不会杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:08.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家不要轻举妄动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:09.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,见机行事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军 将军
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:13.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我帮你把敌人留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你放我回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:26.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:36.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:38.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:40.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:43.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的血肉早就化为善月草的养分了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这 这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:47.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:48.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我的身体不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:49.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:52.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你现在看不惯这副身体了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那方才你嘴里伸出了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:12:00.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只 只不过比普通人的舌头长点罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:01.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:02.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是长了一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你还觉得自己是个人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:07.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我当然是个人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:08.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当然是人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有人舌头长的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.52,0:12:12.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只稍微长了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是为了吃飞虫活命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:18.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,慢慢伸长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:19.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才变成这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:22.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:25.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,活该
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:30.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:36.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他们称这领头的半月人为将军
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:45.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知是什么将军
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:47.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国灭亡时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只有一位将军
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:51.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他的名字翻译成汉文
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:52.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,叫刻磨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,刻磨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:55.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,据说他幼时体弱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,时常受人欺辱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:58.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他发誓变强
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以石刻磨盘锻炼力气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便得了这么个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:04.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实也可以叫大力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:07.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他确实力大无穷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是半月国历代最勇猛的大将
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也是半月国师忠实的拥护者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:14.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死后也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在他是要送我们到半月国师那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:21.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:29.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:33.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,罪人坑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:45.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:35.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,弟兄们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只丢两个下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:44.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其他人带走看好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:46.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:48.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什么事我会先上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:58.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:12.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,阿昭哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:25.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救命 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:26.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:30.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:30.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,且慢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你会说我们的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:36.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是哪里人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:38.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我从中原之地来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:39.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:41.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安后人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:42.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:43.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安国早已被灭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:44.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:46.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在已经没有永安人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:47.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:50.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原人都是永安的后人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:51.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我们的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:52.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把他扔下去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:58.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,半月国已消失两百余年了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你并非我们的国人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,却会我们的语言
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:12.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 将军\N- 救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:12.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:14.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:14.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:14.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 你先来\N- 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:15.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你先来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:16.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:17.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,将军
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这些都是无辜的过路商人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:20.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 何况里面还有孩子\N- 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:20.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何况里面还有孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:21.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:22.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们永安军队血洗我国时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 放开\N- 你们永安军队血洗我国时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:24.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们永安军队血洗我国时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:27.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可没想过这里也有很多无辜的商人和孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:30.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:30.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 放开\N- 你很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:30.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,放开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,- 不能下去\N- 放开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:31.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不能下去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:32.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要问你话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:34.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,丢别的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:36.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是我先跳为敬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:43.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:53.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等等 三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:55.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你先别动
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:56.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:02.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:05.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先离开一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:36.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
